talk! connected
talk< MOTD Welcome to chat.
talk< OK welcome
talk> NICK tom
talk< OK nick tom
talk> JOIN #general
talk< OK join #general members=1 topic=
watch> !events /rooms/general/events?count=2&nick=watcher
watch! connected
watch< HTTP/2 200
watch< content-type: text/event-stream
watch< cache-control: no-cache
watch< 
watch< : watcher joined #general
watch< 
talk> MSG #general first event
talk< * watcher joined #general
talk< OK msg 1
watch< data: <#general> tom: first event
watch< 
talk> MSG #general second event
talk< OK msg 1
watch< data: <#general> tom: second event
watch< 
watch! closed by the server
talk> QUIT
talk< * watcher left #general (connection closed)
talk< OK bye
-- server: history=2
-- endings: quit=1 eof=1 dropped=0 kicked=0 closing=0 broken=0 canceled=0
